OL,3,GNEWSACrash death officers appeal closes
OL,4,Aat #1.2m
OL,5,
OL,6,FA fundraising appeal to help the
OL,7,Ffamilies of two police officers killed
OL,8,Fin a head-on crash has closed after
OL,9,Fclimbing to more than #1.2m.
OL,11,FIt was set up by Cleveland Police
OL,12,FFederation following the deaths of PCs
OL,13,FMatthew Blades and Tom Clough in a
OL,14,Fcollision on the A66 near Middlesbrough
OL,15,Fon 22 August, which also killed five
OL,16,Fyoung men.
OL,18,FThe funds will be split equally between
OL,19,Fthe officers' families for them to do
OL,20,Fwith as they wish.
OL,23,APub: 01-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,392,390,260,160,0,100
